From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yugidraft <yugidraft@localhost>
Date: Sat, 22 Apr 2000 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] core: replace the partner Field Spell on Tag placement

Owner decision 2026-10-07 and Konami Tag Basic Rules: a team can have one Field Spell. MoveToField sends the partner Field Zone card to the Graveyard by rule before placing a new Field Spell, including Set, activation and effect placement. Own-field replacement and other formats retain their stock paths.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019EpX1AcvnigK9dTsxAa5W9
---
 operations.cpp | 12 ++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 12 insertions(+)

diff --git a/operations.cpp b/operations.cpp
index 2074fdf..a468c12 100644
--- a/operations.cpp
+++ b/operations.cpp
@@ -5521,6 +5521,18 @@ bool field::process(Processors::MoveToField& arg) {
 					destroy(pcard, nullptr, REASON_RULE, pcard->current.controler);
 				adjust_all();
 			}
+			// One Field Spell per Tag team, whether the new card is Set or activated.
+			// Use the stock replacement path for the partner's Field Zone too.
+			if(n_duelists == 4 && n_teams == 2) {
+				for(uint8_t q = 0; q < n_duelists; ++q) {
+					if(q == playerid || !is_alive(q) || !same_team(playerid, q))
+						continue;
+					if(auto* old_field = get_field_card(q, LOCATION_SZONE, 5)) {
+						send_to(old_field, nullptr, REASON_RULE, old_field->current.controler, none_id(), LOCATION_GRAVE, 0, 0);
+						adjust_all();
+					}
+				}
+			}
 		} else if(pzone && location == LOCATION_SZONE && (target->data.type & TYPE_PENDULUM) && is_flag(DUEL_PZONE)) {
 			uint32_t flag = 0;
 			if(is_location_useable(playerid, LOCATION_PZONE, 0) && zone & 1)
